flowchart TB
  subgraph STORAGE[Stored data]
    REG[Original file registry<br/>Track registered materials]
    CHK[Chunk text + vector + source<br/>Retrieve evidence with location]
    MAN[Index manifest<br/>Snapshot integrity and config]
  end
  subgraph FLOW[Retrieval flow]
    Q[Question] --> QE[One query embedding<br/>/embeddings API]
    QE --> SS[Similarity search<br/>vs stored document vectors]
    SS --> TF[Threshold filter<br/>Min score: 0.70]
    TF --> RC[Up to 5 chunks<br/>Sorted by similarity]
  end
  STORAGE -.-> SS
